        {
          "text": "句入面嗰個「no need」，我成日都會譯做「唔使」，但正確嘅意思應該係「唔好圍住BearEcho嘅格式去設計」。",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 9.048,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "For \"no need\" in that sentence, I keep defaulting to \"don't need to\" — but the correct reading was \"don't design around BearEcho's format\".",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 9.048,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "條句精準道出咗AI代理而家嘅處境。",
          "start_time": 9.048,
          "end_time": 13.248000000000001,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "That line nails the current state of AI agents.",
          "start_time": 9.048,
          "end_time": 13.248000000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "我哋有冇已經設咗個定時任務去清理垃圾資料？會唔會同嗰個筆記循環重複咗？",
          "start_time": 13.248000000000001,
          "end_time": 21.432000000000002,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "Do we already have a cron for pruning slop? Isn't that overlapping with the notes loop?",
          "start_time": 13.248000000000001,
          "end_time": 21.432000000000002,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "你知唔知，我部手機係小米14 Ultra。",
          "start_time": 21.432000000000002,
          "end_time": 25.776000000000003,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "As you know, my phone is a Xiaomi 14 Ultra.",
          "start_time": 21.432000000000002,
          "end_time": 25.776000000000003,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "我唔知部電話仲可以做啲咩嘢嚟玩下。",
          "start_time": 25.776000000000003,
          "end_time": 29.832000000000004,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm wondering what else this phone can do for fun.",
          "start_time": 25.776000000000003,
          "end_time": 29.832000000000004,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "我而家已經冇再玩手機遊戲咁，而且連成個短視頻APP都拆咗，連Bilibili都唔例外。",
          "start_time": 29.832000000000004,
          "end_time": 37.344,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "I don't play mobile games anymore, and I've uninstalled all the short-video apps — even Bilibili.",
          "start_time": 29.832000000000004,
          "end_time": 37.344,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "end_time": 49.367999999999995,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "到而家為止，我真正會用嘅其實就係微信同 X，其他嘅我就幾乎唔會碰。",
